  "final_text": "New chat\nImages\nPlugins\nDeep research\nSee plans and pricing\nHelp\nSettings\nGet responses tailored to you\n\nLog in to get answers based on saved chats, plus create images and upload files.\n\nLog in\nChatGPT\nLog in\nSign up for free\nYou said:\n\nhii\n\nChatGPT said:\n\nHii! \ud83d\ude0a How are you doing? What can I help you with tonight?\n\nYou said:\n\nhwllo my name is reo\n\nChatGPT said:\n\nHello, Reo! \ud83d\ude04 Nice to meet you! What are you up to?\n\nYou said:\n\nwhats your name\n\nChatGPT said:\n\nI\u2019m ChatGPT! \ud83d\ude0a You can call me ChatGPT, or give me a nickname if you want. \ud83d\ude04\n\nWhat should I call you\u2014Reo?\n\nYou said:\n\nsuper tell mee the 20 best tamil movies\n\nChatGPT said:\n\nAbsolutely, Reo! \ud83d\ude0e\ud83c\udfac If we're talking 20 of the best Tamil movies ever, balancing storytelling, performances, influence, and rewatch value, here's my list:\n\n\ud83c\udfac Nayakan \u2014 Kamal Haasan, Mani Ratnam\n\n\ud83c\udfac Anbe Sivam \u2014 Kamal Haasan, Madhavan\n\n\ud83c\udfac Pariyerum Perumal \u2014 Mari Selvaraj\n\n\ud83c\udfac Thevar Magan \u2014 Kamal Haasan, Sivaji Ganesan\n\n\ud83c\udfac Aruvi \u2014 Arun Prabhu Purushothaman\n\n\ud83c\udfac Super Deluxe \u2014 Thiagarajan Kumararaja\n\n\ud83c\udfac Kaithi \u2014 Karthi, Lokesh Kanagaraj\n\n\ud83c\udfac Vikram Vedha \u2014 Madhavan, Vijay Sethupathi\n\n\ud83c\udfac 96 \u2014 Vijay Sethupathi, Trisha\n\n\ud83c\udfac Ratsasan \u2014 Vishnu Vishal\n\n\ud83c\udfac Vada Chennai \u2014 Dhanush, Vetrimaaran\n\n\ud83c\udfac Visaranai \u2014 Vetrimaaran\n\n\ud83c\udfac Paruthiveeran \u2014 Karthi, Priyamani\n\n\ud83c\udfac Soorarai Pottru \u2014 Suriya, Sudha Kongara\n\n\ud83c\udfac Jai Bhim \u2014 Suriya, T. J. Gnanavel\n\n\ud83c\udfac Aayirathil Oruvan \u2014 Karthi, Selvaraghavan\n\n\ud83c\udfac Aaranya Kaandam \u2014 Thiagarajan Kumararaja\n\n\ud83c\udfac Kaaka Muttai \u2014 M. Manikandan\n\n\ud83c\udfac Mahanadhi \u2014 Kamal Haasan\n\n\ud83c\udfac Iruvar \u2014 Mani Ratnam\n\n\ud83d\udd25 My personal Top 5:\nNayakan \u2192 Anbe Sivam \u2192 Vada Chennai \u2192 Super Deluxe \u2192 Vikram Vedha\n\nIf you tell me what you like\u2014mass, romance, comedy, thriller, horror, gangster, or emotional movies\u2014I can give you a killer Tamil-movie watchlist. \ud83d\ude0e\ud83c\udf7f\n\nChatGPT is AI and can make mistakes.\n\nChat with ChatGPT\nSend message",
